1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,970
- Were you trying to impress Penny?
- No, no, not at all.

2
00:00:03,142 --> 00:00:04,642
(Leonard:)A little bit.

3
00:00:05,144 --> 00:00:06,974
How did that work out for you?

4
00:00:07,146 --> 00:00:08,396
(Penny(entering):)Leonard, ready to go?

5
00:00:08,564 --> 00:00:11,854
Libido, one. Truth, zero.

6
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:14,900
I'm gonna ask one more time.

7
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:17,780
(Leonard:)We did the work together,
let's present the paper together.

8
00:00:17,948 --> 00:00:22,868
(Sheldon:)And I'm telling you for the last time,
it's pandering, it's undignified, and bite me.

9
00:00:24,747 --> 00:00:25,997
(Leonard:)Let's go.

10
00:00:26,165 --> 00:00:28,085
- Bye, Sheldon.
- Goodbye, Penny.

11
00:00:37,426 --> 00:00:38,926
[GRUNTS]

12
00:00:39,094 --> 00:00:41,304
One of these days: Phew!

13
00:00:44,308 --> 00:00:45,348
(Penny:)There you go.

14
00:00:45,517 --> 00:00:47,397
(Leonard:)You're right, this side does look better.

15
00:00:47,561 --> 00:00:50,851
(Penny:)No, no, I didn't say better,
I said less stained.

16
00:00:52,149 --> 00:00:55,239
(Howard:)I just checked the house.
There's probably 20, 25 people in there.

17
00:00:55,402 --> 00:00:56,862
- You're kidding.
- Is that all?

18
00:00:57,029 --> 00:01:01,029
All? In particle physics, 25 is Woodstock.

